    "title": "Your Voice Matters! Goochland County Public Schools is launching a",
    "text": "Your Voice Matters! Goochland County Public Schools is launching a\nDetails for Your Voice Matters! Goochland County Public Schools is launching a\nUpdated\nYour Voice Matters! Goochland County Public Schools is launching a strategic planning process to guide our priorities and goals for the coming years. In late September, four surveys will gather input from: Students in grades 612 Parents/Guardians of PK12 students GCPS Staff The Greater Goochland Community Your feedback will help ensure GCPS continues to provide exceptional learning opportunities and prepare every student for future success. Visit goochlandschools.org/strategic-plan to learn more and access the surveys when they open. Together, we can build a strong plan for the future of our schools and community!",
